<title>USA: Brassie Golf says negotiating with Divot.</title>
<headline>Brassie Golf says negotiating with Divot.</headline>
<dateline>TAMPA, Fla 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brassie Golf Corp said Thursday it was renegotiating the terms of a possible combination or other business relationship with Tampa, Florida-based Divot Golf Corp.</p>
<p>The parties do not presently have any agreement in principle on a proposed transaction.</p>
</text>
